Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Advanced chips depend on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.83,0:00:01.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,EUV lithography.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:02.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Without it, leading-edge chipmaking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.97,0:00:04.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,loses a qualified step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,EUV lithography system occupies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,a specialized step in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:10.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,semiconductors, linking capacity, interfaces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:11.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,and operating knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:13.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,If it disappears, capacity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:15.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,tightens first. Wider effects
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,depend on inventories, qualified
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:19.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,substitutes and recovery time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:21.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Real resilience comes from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:22.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,spares, diversified capacity and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:24.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,recovery plans tested before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,the bottleneck fails.
